@startuml WeClawBotNotify_ChangePasswordSequence

title WeClawBotNotify V1 - 修改密码序列图\n(Client Auth · 修改密码)

actor "用户" as User
participant "Web 管理后台\n(浏览器)" as Web
participant "server/HTTPServer" as API
participant "middleware/ClientAuth" as ClientAuth
participant "user/ChangePasswordLogic" as ChangePwd
participant "model/UsersModel" as UserModel
participant "model/RefreshTokensModel" as RTModel
participant "SQLite" as DB

User -> Web : 打开修改密码页面\n输入旧密码和新密码
activate Web

Web -> API : POST /api/user/password\n{ old_password, new_password }\nAuthorization: Bearer {accessToken}
activate API

API -> ClientAuth : authenticate(request)
activate ClientAuth

note right of ClientAuth
  ClientAuth 中间件：
  验证 Access Token
  提取 userId 放入 Context
end note

ClientAuth --> API : userId (from JWT Claims)
deactivate ClientAuth

API -> ChangePwd : ChangePassword(req)
activate ChangePwd

ChangePwd -> ChangePwd : 验证新密码强度\n(长度>=8, 大小写+数字)

alt 新密码强度不足
  ChangePwd --> API : error: PasswordTooWeak (110400)
  API --> Web : 400 { code: 110400, msg: "密码强度不足" }
  Web --> User : 提示"密码需至少8位且包含大小写字母和数字"
  deactivate ChangePwd
  deactivate API
  return
else 新密码强度合格

  ChangePwd -> UserModel : FindOne(userId)
  activate UserModel
  UserModel -> DB : SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> UserModel : User { id, username, password_hash }
  deactivate DB
  UserModel --> ChangePwd : user
  deactivate UserModel

  ChangePwd -> ChangePwd : bcrypt.CompareHashAndPassword\n(old_password, user.password_hash)

  alt 旧密码错误
    ChangePwd --> API : error: LoginPasswordWrong (110202)
    API --> Web : 401 { code: 110202, msg: "用户名或密码错误" }
    Web --> User : 提示"旧密码错误"
    deactivate ChangePwd
    deactivate API
    return
  else 旧密码正确

    ChangePwd -> ChangePwd : bcrypt.GenerateFromPassword\n(new_password, DefaultCost)
    ChangePwd -> UserModel : Update(user with new password_hash)
    activate UserModel
    UserModel -> DB : UPDATE users\nSET password_hash = ?\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> UserModel : OK
    deactivate DB
    UserModel --> ChangePwd : nil
    deactivate UserModel

    ChangePwd -> RTModel : RevokeByUserId(userId)
    activate RTModel
    RTModel -> DB : UPDATE refresh_tokens\nSET revoked = 1\nWHERE user_id = ? AND revoked = 0
    activate DB
    DB --> RTModel : OK
    deactivate DB
    RTModel --> ChangePwd : nil
    deactivate RTModel

    note over ChangePwd, DB
      安全机制：
      修改密码后撤销所有 Refresh Token
      强制所有设备重新登录
      防止被盗用的会话继续使用
    end note

    ChangePwd --> API : ChangePasswordResp {}
    deactivate ChangePwd

    API --> Web : 200 OK\n{ code: 0, msg: "请求成功" }
    deactivate API

    Web --> User : ✅ 密码修改成功\n请重新登录
    deactivate Web

  end
end

@enduml
